    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Guard Against the Horrors of the Night</p></blockquote><p>The twilit passage from light into darkness often brings calm and even joy, as the day's labors end and the hours of rest begin. The darkness can also bring terrors, but the gods of twilight guard against the horrors of the night. Their Clerics bring comfort to those who seek rest and protect them by venturing into the encroaching darkness, so that the dark is a comfort, not a terror.</p><h4>Twilight Domain Deities</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Example Deity</th><th>Pantheon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Boldrei</td><td>Eberron</td></tr><tr><td>Celestian</td><td>Greyhawk</td></tr><tr><td>Dol Arrah</td><td>Eberron</td></tr><tr><td>Helm</td><td>Forgotten Realms</td></tr><tr><td>Ilmater</td><td>Forgotten Realms</td></tr><tr><td>Mishakal</td><td>Dragonlance</td></tr><tr><td>Selûne</td><td>Forgotten Realms</td></tr><tr><td>Yondalla</td><td>Halfling</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><p><em>Its Divine Strike (Cleric level 8) is replaced by the Blessed Strikes of the 2024 Cleric.</em></p><h3>Twilight Domain Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.PamC5HXoaXkmndwE]{Twilight Domain Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.RiG8Kq3Ltzzn4QMs]{Bonus Proficiencies}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.xQyGqAmbcjFKf4sQ]{Eyes of Night}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.9K6Ok4ISM6ew8BoC]{Vigilant Blessing}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.T3mMel3ofAyYFdfs]{Twilight Sanctuary}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.2gBIpCCV4Cm9NY7f]{Steps of Night}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.dj1ikJFhpLcgKwr1]{Twilight Shroud}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Twilight Domain Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFaerieFire]{Faerie Fire}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMoonbeam00]{Moonbeam}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSeeInvisib]{See Invisibility}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSleep00000]{Sleep}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.ap9j32ixgVwRkURC]{Aura of Vitality}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLeomundsTi]{Leomund's Tiny Hut}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAuraofLife]{Aura of Life}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterInv]{Greater Invisibility}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.Ydjq7AY2mw80wgeM]{Circle of Power}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMislead000]{Mislead}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
